{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/Frise_1Personnages.png?t=1749250144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an epic new chapter of Spellcaster University's magical world with the &quot;Steam Age&quot; expansion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/BanderolesGoblin_deck.png?t=1749250144\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain access to new goblin cards by collaborating with an engineer, temporarily destabilizing your school in exchange for new opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire goblins to maintain your new steam machines.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Capitalize on the adjacency mechanics of the new goblin rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a09 new rooms, 8 new artifacts, 3 new familiars, 2 new pieces of equipment, various goblin types, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/GIFGobelin.gif?t=1749250144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/BanderolesRare_and_legendary_cards.png?t=1749250144\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All rooms from the base game now have rare and legendary variants, each providing special buffs to help specialize your school.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/GIFCarte2.gif?t=1749250144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/BanderolesNew_levels.png?t=1749250144\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle the bitter cold of the ice expanse. Negotiate with mammoth-folk, purchase woolly hats and scarves for your students, and work with the goblins to beat the biting cold.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the delights of the toxic canyon. Admire the radioactive lake, handle your students' toxic mutations, and assist the Goblin King.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/GIFTerrain.gif?t=1749250144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/Frise_2Voisins.png?t=1749250144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350300?t=1749250144","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350300?t=1749250144","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/269b65af56801b0ea6b18ab02a808fd9ff30f80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749250144","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/269b65af56801b0ea6b18ab02a808fd9ff30f80e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749250144","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350300/extras/Frise_1Personnages.png?t=1749250144\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an epic new chapter of Spellcaster University's magical world with the &qu